<title>USA: Monsanto Co Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Monsanto Co Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net			274,000		  260,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,574,000		2,304,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 602,600		  598,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 includes $101.0 million pretax write-off ($63.0 million or $0.10 a share after-tax) for acquired in-process research and development, and $0.01 a share accounting change charge.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
